	measure 'Pending Vehicle Count by Age' = ```
			
			VAR Sel = SELECTEDVALUE ( AgeBuckets[Sort] )
			RETURN
			CALCULATE (
			    SUMX (
			        'gold_dpmc_vs_2w3w_factpendingbooking_v2',
			        VAR Conf = 'gold_dpmc_vs_2w3w_factpendingbooking_v2'[ConfirmDate]
			        VAR BucketNo =
			            IF (
			                ISBLANK ( Conf ), 5,
			                VAR AgeDays =
			                    DATEDIFF ( Conf, 'gold_dpmc_vs_2w3w_factpendingbooking_v2'[DMT_LOADED_DATE], DAY )
			                RETURN
			                    IF ( AgeDays <= 30, 1,
			                    IF ( AgeDays <= 60, 2,
			                    IF ( AgeDays <= 80, 3, 4 ) ) )
			            )
			        RETURN
			            IF (
			                ISBLANK ( Sel ) || BucketNo = Sel,
			                'gold_dpmc_vs_2w3w_factpendingbooking_v2'[VehicleCount],
			                0
			            )
			    ),
			    'gold_dpmc_vs_2w3w_factpendingbooking_v2'[InvoiceStatus] = "PENDING"
			   
			) + 0
			```
		formatString: 0
		lineageTag: 47504875-c0d0-461b-8eb1-88c80faadc97

